WEBVTT

00:05:39.619 --> 00:05:41.328
Ačiu.

00:05:41.328 --> 00:05:43.610
EDI: Ačiu.

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.520
(Plojimai)

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:51.811
(Muzika)

00:05:51.811 --> 00:05:53.570
MT: Štai ir viskas.
Ačiū jums labai.

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:56.841
Ir ačiū tau EDI.
EDI: Ačiū tau Marco.

00:05:56.841 --> 00:06:00.841
(Plojimai)